# 行尾统一：仓库内一律 LF，Windows 脚本例外。
#
# 本机 core.autocrlf=true 会把工作区的 LF 改写成 CRLF，导致 clone 下来满仓
# "整个文件被修改"的假 diff。仓库级 .gitattributes 优先于全局配置。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.whl binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
